From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Change background color to white

Change the default background color from light gray (#ECECE1) to white
(#FFFFFF) for a cleaner boot splash appearance.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [configuration]
Signed-off-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

--- a/psplash-colors.h
+++ b/psplash-colors.h
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@
 #define _HAVE_PSPLASH_COLORS_H

 /* This is the overall background color */
-#define PSPLASH_BACKGROUND_COLOR 0xec,0xec,0xe1
+#define PSPLASH_BACKGROUND_COLOR 0xff,0xff,0xff

 /* This is the color of any text output */
 #define PSPLASH_TEXT_COLOR 0x6d,0x6d,0x70
@@ -21,6 +21,6 @@
 #define PSPLASH_BAR_COLOR 0x6d,0x6d,0x70

 /* This is the color of the progress bar background */
-#define PSPLASH_BAR_BACKGROUND_COLOR 0xec,0xec,0xe1
+#define PSPLASH_BAR_BACKGROUND_COLOR 0xff,0xff,0xff

 #endif
